buttons: capture, release, fast click, disabled, distinct IDs
keyboard: tab, reverse wrap, enter, removed focus, isolated contexts
checkbox and identity: release-only toggle; IDs survive reordered layout
sliders: capture, clamp, keyboard step, equal bounds, disabled
text: Unicode code points, insertion, deletion, capacity, commit
focus loss: window blur, disappearing control, escape cancellation
clipped focus: hidden navigation, stale focus/capture, partial visibility
cancellation: Escape/blur win over click, keys, edits and navigation
drawing: flexible rows, clipping, progress, rectangle, RGBA
validation: lifecycle, IDs, layout, finite values, NUL
miniui: 10 headless scenarios passed
[exit 0]
